            "text": "theorem weightedSource_pull {l : ℝ} (hl : l ≠ 0) (C : E →L[ℝ] F)\n    (u : ℝ) (f : ℝ × F → ℝ) :\n    PressureStream.weightedSource (pull l C u f) =\n      pull l C (u / l) (PressureStream.weightedSource f)"
